  "family_quality_rules": [
    "Mythic quality comes from monumental composition and distinctive forms, not dense magical decoration.",
    "Use one sacred or unusual landmark as the environmental focal support.",
    "Runes, sparkles, carvings, and symbols must stay sparse and large.",
    "Natural and built sacred spaces should remain highly colorable with quiet surrounding areas."
